infra Plunder Pipeline — Full Simulation
slo-p90-latency-ms 2000

tag Crew as c
  Lookout teal default
  Quartermaster blue
  Purser purple
  Navigator orange

Edge
  rps: 600
  -> CrowsNest

CrowsNest c: Lookout
  description: Spots sails; most are ships already logged
  cache-hit: 40%
  -> NavyScreen

NavyScreen c: Lookout
  description: Turns away navy frigates flying false colours
  firewall-block: 10%
  ratelimit-rps: 2000
  -> Quartermaster

Quartermaster c: Quartermaster
  -/gold-> [Treasury] split: 50%
  -/cargo-> Fence split: 30%
  -/charts-> ChartRoom split: 20%

[Treasury]
  instances: 2-4

  Purser c: Purser
    description: Weighs the haul and books each share
    max-rps: 100
    latency-ms: 60
    cb-error-threshold: 50%
    -> LedgerDB
    ~share.owed~> ShareQueue

LedgerDB c: Purser
  max-rps: 2000
  latency-ms: 8
  uptime: 99.99%

ShareQueue c: Purser
  buffer: 5000
  drain-rate: 150
  retention-hours: 72
  -> Payout

Payout c: Purser
  concurrency: 60
  duration-ms: 300
  cold-start-ms: 900

Fence c: Quartermaster
  description: Port Royal dealer for silks and rum
  max-rps: 400
  latency-ms: 400

ChartRoom c: Navigator
  description: Plots the next prize across the sea charts
  max-rps: 300
  latency-ms: 90
  -> ChartShards fanout: 4

ChartShards c: Navigator
  max-rps: 4000
  latency-ms: 5
